<title>SWITZERLAND: Swissair H1 loss narrows to 51 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Swissair H1 loss narrows to 51 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net loss		 51		  vs 86</p>
<p> Operating revenue	    3,613	     vs 3,263</p>
<p> Operating expenditure	3,593	     vs 3,246</p>
<p> Operating profit	     20		  vs 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Swissair Schweizerische Luftverkehr AG. Analysts had forecast a first half net loss of 51 million Swiss francs.  </p>
<p> Financial result	     26 loss	   vs 58 loss</p>
<p> Extraordinary result	 zero		vs 14 loss</p>
<p> Taxes			    38		  vs 26</p>
<p> Cash flow			251		 vs 168</p>
<p> Minorities		     7		   vs 5</p>
</text>
